{"id":"601ad32e52e9aa55","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion.md","title":"固定点稳定性的剖面判据","display":"prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion — 固定点稳定性的剖面判据","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion","aliases":["91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion","91-prop-stability-criterion","91-prop-paradox-stability"],"display":"prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion — 固定点稳定性的剖面判据","depends_on":["[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion</span><span>91-prop-stability-criterion</span><span>91-prop-paradox-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-paradox-sentence-stability-criterion — 固定点稳定性的剖面判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (非空的一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点评价)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a> 的稳定性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (极小一致固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Gamma)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}criterion}\n\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\right|=1\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}criterion}\n\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\right|=1\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf t\\},\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf t\\},\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极小性保证极小固定点中已经取得的真或假信息进入每个一致固定点，故\n第二行给出稳定真、稳定假的充分条件。反之，极小固定点中的 gap 不能\n区分稳定 gap 与固定点依赖句：真理陈述者就是反例。</p>\n<p>从空集递增的 Kripke 构造不会“振荡”；真理陈述者若未被启动会一直\n保持 gap。把后期反复改变真值作为判据属于修正序列语义，不能与\nKripke 固定点阶段混用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)$ (见 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的稳定性谓词)","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\Gamma(\\varphi):\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_{\\min}\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}stability\\text{-}criterion}\n\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Stable}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left|\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\right|=1\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MinFix}_c(\\Gamma_{\\min},J)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&\\to\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf t\\},\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma_{\\min}\n&\\to\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)=\\{\\mathbf f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true}],"bytes":2188,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["3a19d5715745463a","460308c7099a8386"]}